Package: sshtest
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: awesomeshot5051 englandtechnologies@gmail.com
Depends: bash, openssh-client
Recommends: sshpass
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Wait for a host to come up and accept SSH logins
 sshtest polls a host until it accepts SSH logins, with adjustable
 verbosity. Uses sshpass for password checks when available.
